Third-party files

The following files are not covered by the MIT license above. They keep the
license stated in each file:

- testvectors/onchain/: verified source code of deployed contracts, fetched
  from Blockscout (mostly GPL-3.0; Hermez AGPL-3.0; some MIT or unlabeled)
- testvectors/synthetic/*.sol: verifiers generated from snarkjs templates
  (GPL-3.0), and testvectors/synthetic/bytecode/ compiled from them
